      "description": "A ruled settings row: label over hint, trailing arrow.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-row\" href=\"#\"><span><span class=\"ds-row-label\">Privacy</span><span class=\"ds-row-hint\">What stays on this iPad</span></span><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14 M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;min-height:60px;padding:.75rem .5rem;border-block:1px solid var(--rule);color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--font-ui);transition:background-color 120ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-row>span{display:grid;gap:2px}.ds-row-hint{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.882rem}.ds-row svg{color:var(--ink-soft)}.ds-row:hover{background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--linen) 55%,transparent)}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent-ink);outline-offset:2px}"
